[{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":65,"col":5},"end":{"line":65,"col":16}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`update` changes `model#Article.0.errors` in place, and the checker cannot show\nthat nothing else still holds the list.\n\n65|    Tea.element\n       ^^^^^^^^^^^ the runtime hands `update` the model here\n\nBuild the messages the page sends from values that are not the model's lists, or\nhave `update` change a copy of what a message carries, made with `List.copy`.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: a message a view event\nbuilds may hold it — a list of the model, or one a handler keeps from one\ndispatch to the next — and the check does not tell update's arms apart."}]
